{"rpid": "844866496", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "To tell me who I am, who I was 　　Uncertainty enveloping my mind 　　\nTill I can't break free, and 　　\nMaybe it's a dream; maybe nothing else is real 　　\nBut it wouldn't mean a thing if I told you how I feel 　　\nSo I'm tired of all the pain, of the misery inside", "like": 1, "ctime": 1529290443, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "844866910", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "And I wish that I could live feeling nothing but the night 　　\nYou can tell me what to say; you can tell me where to go 　　\nBut I doubt that I would care, and my heart would never know 　　\nIf I make another move there'll be no more turning back", "like": 1, "ctime": 1529290461, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "844867411", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "Because everything will change, and it all will fade to black 　　\nWill tomorrow ever come? Will I make it through the night? 　　\nWill there ever be a place for the broken in the light? 　　\nAm I hurting? Am I sad? Should I stay, or should I go? 　　\nI've forgotten how to tell. Did I ever even know? 　　\nCan I take another step? I've done everything I can 　　\nAll the people that I see I will never understand", "like": 1, "ctime": 1529290486, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "844867999", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "If I find a way to change, if I step into the light 　　\nThen I'll never be the same, and it all will fade to white 　　\nEver on and on I continue circling 　　With nothing but my hate in a carousel of agony 　　\nTill slowly I forget and my heart starts vanishing 　　\nAnd suddenly I see that I can't break free--I'm 　　\nSlipping through the cracks of a dark eternity 　　\nWith nothing but my pain and the paralyzing agony 　　\nTo tell me who I am, who I was 　　Uncertainty enveloping my mind 　　\nTill I can't break free, and 　　\nMaybe it's a dream; maybe nothing else is real", "like": 1, "ctime": 1529290510, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "844868740", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "But it wouldn't mean a thing if I told you how I feel 　　\nSo I'm tired of all the pain, of the misery inside 　　\nAnd I wish that I could live feeling nothing but the night 　　\nYou can tell me what to say; you can tell me where to go 　　\nBut I doubt that I would care, and my heart would never know 　　\nIf I make another move there'll be no more turning back", "like": 2, "ctime": 1529290543, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "844869682", "root": "844865857", "parent": "844865857", "uname": "千城默念", "mid": "84632587", "level": 6, "vip": 0, "content": "Because everything will change, and it all will fade to black 　　\nIf I make another move, if I take another step 　　\nThen it all would fall apart. There'd be nothing of me left 　　\nIf I'm crying in the wind, if I'm crying in the night 　　\nWill there ever be a way? Will my heart return to white? 　　\nCan you tell me who you are? Can you tell me where I am? 　　\nI've forgotten how to see; I've forgotten if I can 　　\nIf I opened up my eyes there'd be no more going back 　　'\nCause I'd throw it all away, and it all would fade to black.", "like": 2, "ctime": 1529290591, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "575385", "video_bvid": "BV1Ss411Z7rQ", "video_title": "【Oliver】Bad Apple!! (Dark Trance Remix)【VOCALOID3】", "video_desc": "youtube 这伴奏挺带感的0 0", "video_owner": "艾柔玛", "video_view": 3410, "video_reply": 19, "video_n1": 11, "video_n2": 8}
